  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development is located within surface water flood zone 3b, 3a, and fluvial\r\nflood zone 3 &amp;amp; 2. In the absence of a satisfactory Flood Risk Assessment,\r\nit has not been demonstrated that the proposed development would not exacerbate\r\nthe risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of\r\nflooding elsewhere, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicy SI 12 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of the Harrow Core\r\nStrategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development Management\r\nPolicies Local Plan (2013) and Draft Harrow Local Plan GR1 and CN3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
